# The server image needs the Rust workspace (module, rule crates, import tool) and server/.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!module/
!import/
!godot/rust/
!server/
!tools/wiki-gen/
!export/
# Just enough of .git for the server to know its commit (module/build.rs).
!.git/HEAD
!.git/packed-refs
!.git/refs/
module/target/
godot/rust/target/
